ry, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e1","era":null,"summary":"Sentos wakes after the wind slams the door, finds the poison flask empty and shattered, and sees a statue of a frightened monk outside.","participants":["sentos"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"minor","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":8,"quote":"But the stonecutter had carved fear into the monk's elderly features.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=But%20the%20stonecutter%20had,the%20monk%27s%20elderly%20features.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=But%20the%20stonecutter%20had,the%20monk%27s%20elderly%20features.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e2","era":null,"summary":"A woman holds a blade to Sentos's throat and demands to know whether he is Sentos the Merciful.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":11,"quote":"\"Are you Sentos the Merciful?\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22Are%20you%20Sentos%20the%20Merciful%3F%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22Are%20you%20Sentos%20the%20Merciful%3F%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e3","era":null,"summary":"The woman stabs Sentos in the back and makes him recount what happened on Fleet Rock, and he says the silver-haired man was the false king.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid","false-king"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":20,"quote":"\"No one told me he was the false king.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22No%20one%20told%20me,was%20the%20false%20king.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22No%20one%20told%20me,was%20the%20false%20king.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e4","era":null,"summary":"Sentos lies that he spared the false king out of mercy, concealing that he accepted the ring for his wife.","participants":["sentos","false-king"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":26,"quote":"I did it out of mercy.\" I