nk":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=The%20gorgon%27s%20foot%20slammed,nest%20of%20petrified%20snakes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e9","era":null,"summary":"The gorgon cuts off Sentos's finger and takes the ring, which grants ceaseless life.","participants":["gorgon-of-xathrid","sentos","ring-of-ceaseless-life"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"With her blade, she sliced off his finger, taking the ring for her own.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=With%20her%20blade%2C%20she,ring%20for%20her%20own.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=With%20her%20blade%2C%20she,ring%20for%20her%20own.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e10","era":null,"summary":"Without the ring, the venom kills Sentos; he looks the gorgon in the face and is turned to stone, and her blade strikes stone.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":41,"quote":"But he heard the tip of her blade meet the stone of his face.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=But%20he%20heard%20the,stone%20of%20his%20face.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=But%20he%20heard%20the,stone%20of%20his%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}}],"relations":[{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-r1","source":"wizards","relation":"killed","target":"sentos","note":"She petrifies him after taking the ring.","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","paragraph":41,"quote":"Instead, Sentos twisted his neck and gazed at the gorgon's face.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=Instead%2C%20Sentos%20twisted%20his,at%20the%20gorgon%27s%20face.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=Instead%2C%20Sentos%20twisted%20his,at%20the%20gorgon%27s%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}}],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":342,"story_date":"2012-07-03","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"A twenty-six-year-old veteran of the war in Thune who ended it by sparing a false king, and who is petrified after killing himself fails to go as planned.","citation":{"sourc